WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.511
A ship? Everyone, there's a ship!

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.221
A ship?

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.098
Really?

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.017
We're saved!

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:18.101
Hey!

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:19.561
Hello!

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:21.062
Over here!

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:22.522
Look over here!

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.441
-Please help us!
-Hey!

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.609
-Hello!
-Hey!

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.902
Somebody!

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:34.826
It doesn't look like
they'll be helping us.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:37.912
There's nobody on that ship.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.832
It's abandoned
and it's just floating around.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.084
Oh, but look!

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:47.380
That's a Japanese ship, right?

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:51.843
He's right! If there's a ship,
we must be close to the shore.

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:53.303
Yes. That's true.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.055
We're really in Japan!

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:56.431
We made it.

00:00:56.681 --> 00:00:58.058
We found our way back.

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:05.148
-What? What's that?
-Not sure.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:07.400
That must be...

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:14.866
Yokohama Landmark Tower and hotel.

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:20.705
That's impossible.

